### Government Mock APIs — REST Client Test File
### Install the "REST Client" extension in VS Code to use this file.
### Click "Send Request" above any block to run it.

@drp = http://localhost:8081/api
@dmt = http://localhost:8082/api
@apiKey = dl-gov-secret-key-change-in-production

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
#  HEALTH CHECKS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### DRP Health
GET {{drp}}/health
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### DMT Health
GET {{dmt}}/health
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
#  DRP — CITIZENS
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### List all citizens (paginated)
GET {{drp}}/citizens?page=1&limit=20
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Get citizen by NIC
GET {{drp}}/citizens/nic/198522405678
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Get citizen by UUID (replace with actual ID)
GET {{drp}}/citizens/5997302d-2ef1-49eb-9703-4844f1f9fff7
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Create a new citizen
POST {{drp}}/citizens
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "S.M. SILVA",
  "name_on_card": "S.M. Silva",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "date_of_birth": "1992-04-18",
  "nic": "199204500123",
  "ic_number": "IC-0000003",
  "place_of_birth": "Kandy",
  "district_of_birth": "Kandy",
  "address_house": "15/B",
  "address_road": "Peradeniya Road",
  "address_city": "Kandy",
  "address_postal_code": "20000",
  "issued_date": "2015-06-10"
}

###

### Update a citizen (replace UUID)
PUT {{drp}}/citizens/5997302d-2ef1-49eb-9703-4844f1f9fff7
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "address_city": "Colombo 05",
  "address_postal_code": "00500"
}

###

### Test: No API key (should return 401)
GET {{drp}}/citizens

###

### Test: Wrong API key (should return 401)
GET {{drp}}/citizens
X-Gov-Api-Key: wrong-key

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
#  DMT — VEHICLE CLASSES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### List all 14 vehicle class definitions
GET {{dmt}}/vehicle-classes
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

# ─────────────────────────────────────────
#  DMT — DRIVING LICENCES
# ─────────────────────────────────────────

### List all licences
GET {{dmt}}/licences?page=1&limit=20
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Get licence by NIC
GET {{dmt}}/licences/nic/198503402948
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Get licence by licence number
GET {{dmt}}/licences/number/DL-9044231-X
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Get vehicle classes for a licence (replace UUID)
GET {{dmt}}/licences/f3af8b74-c531-4c29-9859-7eb1d133a4cd/classes
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

###

### Create a new licence with vehicle classes
POST {{dmt}}/licences
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "licence_number": "DL-1234567-B",
  "nic": "199204500123",
  "surname": "SILVA",
  "other_names": "S.M.",
  "full_name_on_card": "S.M. SILVA",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "date_of_birth": "1992-04-18",
  "blood_group": "B+",
  "height_ft": 5,
  "height_inches": 4,
  "permanent_address": "15/B, Peradeniya Road, Kandy",
  "organ_donor": false,
  "driver_restrictions": "NONE",
  "vehicle_classes": [
    { "class_code": "B",  "issued_date": "2018-03-22", "expiry_date": "2028-03-22" },
    { "class_code": "A1", "issued_date": "2018-03-22", "expiry_date": "2028-03-22" }
  ]
}

###

### Add extra vehicle classes to existing licence (replace UUID)
POST {{dmt}}/licences/f3af8b74-c531-4c29-9859-7eb1d133a4cd/classes
X-Gov-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "class_code": "C", "issued_date": "2022-08-15", "expiry_date": "2032-08-15" }
]
